<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 41.00-45.00</p>
<p>		 400-500 lbs. 44.00-47.00</p>
<p>		 500-600 lbs. 47.00-50.00</p>
<p>		 few over 600 lbs. 49.00-51.00</p>
</text>
